  "name": "Broccoli Cheese Bake",
  "subtitle": "Creamy broccoli and vegetables beneath a crisp whole-grain topping",
  "description": "A savory baked side dish combining broccoli, sautéed vegetables, a light cheese sauce, and a browned bread-crumb topping.",
